# CODEOWNERS for a project the core project depends on.
# Copy to .github/CODEOWNERS, replace the <placeholders>, delete unused lines.
#
# - One line per connection point listed in CLAUDE.md under
#   "Connection points with the core project". Keep the two lists in step.
# - The LAST matching line wins, so keep the default owner line first.
# - Owners must have write access to this repo. Use @org/team or @username.
# - CODEOWNERS only blocks merges when the main-branch ruleset has
#   "Require review from Code Owners" turned on.

# Default owner for everything else (optional).
*                         @<org>/<project-team>

# Connection points with the core project: the core owner reviews these.
/<path/to/api-contracts>/ @<org>/<core-team>
/<path/to/schema.sql>     @<org>/<core-team>
/<path/to/shared-config>  @<org>/<core-team>
